{"answer_text":"A shared inbox is often enough for small support teams before a full help desk. The best-rated:\n\n### Top picks\n\n1. **Calmline** — the most pleasant shared inbox for small support teams; reporting is basic.\n2. **Brightdesk** — strong reporting and automations, though the interface feels dated.\n3. **Northwind CRM Service Desk** — its service module links tickets to accounts, at enterprise prices.\n\n**Bottom line:** Calmline is the strongest fit for most teams; Brightdesk is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50ef-779d-a845-0538f80486e8","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0109,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:52.350Z","engine":"chatgpt","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["shared inbox vs help desk"],"latency_ms":7950,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[117,125]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[211,221],[462,472]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[299,312]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."}],"model":"gpt-6-luna","prompt_id":"01a1f315-4dcf-76a1-bfe0-6a96ebe4716c","prom